can hit that curveball."

00:04:31.150 --> 00:04:34.550
So now that the ball is
thrown at me and it's a curve,

00:04:34.550 --> 00:04:36.630
and it's a pretty fast one,

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:39.460
and now I got to learn how
to just swing it and hit it,

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:41.030
and that's what I'm doing today,

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:44.240
