00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:45.633
into something positive.

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:50.210
When I made this decision,

00:04:50.210 --> 00:04:51.905
I don't know if I should go now with,

00:04:51.905 --> 00:04:53.823
my story.
- [Interviewer] Yeah.

00:04:56.170 --> 00:05:01.170
- I was younger, and I was 18 years old,

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:03.930
