baby sister's phone number.

00:05:37.707 --> 00:05:40.000
And I was like, "What the fuck?"

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.117
So I started thinking to myself,

00:05:42.117 --> 00:05:44.200
"Okay, should I be nosy?" or whatever,

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:46.871
