00:09:41.490 --> 00:09:45.750
And by this time, this man still out cold,

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:47.530
and I toss him out.

00:09:47.530 --> 00:09:52.300
And God, somebody up there
must have loved this guy

00:09:52.300 --> 00:09:57.300
