actually get back up,

00:09:58.310 --> 00:10:00.210
from whatever I did,

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:02.180
and I thought I got away with it

00:10:02.180 --> 00:10:04.462
because I'm in my living room.

00:10:04.462 --> 00:10:09.462
This a little long down
the road, a month later.

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:10.960
I thought I got away with it.

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:13.570
Everybody's calling me,
"Hey, have you seen Robert?"

00:10:13.570 --> 00:10:15.620
