00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:55.620
And I'm like, "No, I don't do anything."

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:57.937
So, they come in and they're like,

00:10:57.937 --> 00:11:01.923
"We're here because you're
last seen with Robert Lopez."

00:11:01.923 --> 00:11:05.056
And this is where they got me, is that,

00:11:05.056 --> 00:11:07.370
I was like, "I thought
that dude was gone."

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:11.157
And they're like, "No, he's been in ICU.

00:11:11.157 --> 00:11:15.120
"He's been in an intensive
care, Hi-Desert Hospital."

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:19.050
And I was like, "Oh, okay,
and so why are you guys here?"

00:11:19.050 --> 00:11:20.537
And they look at me and they're like,

00:11:20.537 --> 00:11:21.780
