by saying "I was with him."

00:11:44.190 --> 00:11:46.330
And this is where it starts.

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:49.180
They arrest me, I go to jail.

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:51.033
And within that time in jail,

00:11:53.567 --> 00:11:58.567
