00:15:03.660 --> 00:15:07.530
And I really did, and unfortunately,

00:15:07.530 --> 00:15:09.786
he didn't die but. (chuckles)

00:15:09.786 --> 00:15:13.090
I'm sorry, all I can
do is pray for the guy,

00:15:13.090 --> 00:15:15.780
