00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:31.199
And, I look over at my wife,
she's crying but she was happy

00:15:31.199 --> 00:15:34.920
because I'm not gonna spend
the rest of my life in prison.

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:39.080
I signed the 20 years,

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:42.650
and I ended up doing 15 out of those 20,

00:15:42.650 --> 00:15:47.650
because I went from an all-out church boy,

00:15:47.690 --> 00:15:51.630
