that you don't want to,

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:09.840
and that's why I ended
up doing 15 instead of 10

00:16:09.840 --> 00:16:12.110
because it was my first conviction,

00:16:12.110 --> 00:16:14.380
and I ended up catching five years

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:19.380
for three institutional stabbings.

00:16:22.520 --> 00:16:23.742
And sometimes you have to do that.

00:16:23.742 --> 00:16:27.250
If anybody knows anything about prison,

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:31.360
like when it comes to your
time to putting in your work,

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:32.500
you gotta put it in.

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:34.750
Even though you don't want to,

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:38.223
it's something that you have to do.

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:41.640
Sometimes, it's kinda
fun participating in it,

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:46.200
but my last five years were segregated.

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:52.830
I was in Corc in SHU, which
they call it The Green Wall,

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:55.290
the hardest prison you could go to.

00:16:55.290 --> 00:17:00.290
It's the hardest ad seg, ASU,
that you could possibly go to.

00:17:01.810 --> 00:17:03.970
It's all concrete.

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:08.217
The only person you see is the deputy,

00:17:08.217 --> 00:17:10.265
and sometimes you're so freaking bored

00:17:10.265 --> 00:17:11.940
when they're walking by,

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:13.567
you need somebody to
talk to so you're like,

00:17:13.567 --> 00:17:15.740
"Hey, what's up deputy, yeah
yeah yeah, how you doin'?"

00:17:15.740 --> 00:17:17.250
You know, trying to get any words at him

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:21.400
because you're in that
block, concrete room,

00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:23.700
that little slot, they
really make you feel like

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:26.270
you're in segregated ICU.

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:31.270
And so, I would do that, and
I spent my time working out

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:35.283
and doing that but,

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:38.523
I did those 15.

00:17:41.350 --> 00:17:45.440
It was crazy because when I got out,

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:46.833
I got out and,

00:17:49.748 --> 00:17:50.581
it was different.

00:17:50.581 --> 00:17:55.300
Everything changed on me, like
now I have a gang background.

00:17:56.270 --> 00:18:00.950
I've acquired a lot of
different new hobbies,

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:03.990
as in drug addiction.

00:18:03.990 --> 00:18:08.990
I have became something that
I didn't really want to be,

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:14.370
but I wouldn't change the decision I made

00:18:14.370 --> 00:18:16.910
because I mean, I felt
that it was something good.

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:19.050
That I did good for my little baby sister

00:18:19.050 --> 00:18:21.990
because otherwise, she would
have went another route

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:23.100
