00:18:32.800 --> 00:18:34.280
- Yeah, yeah, he molested her,

00:18:34.280 --> 00:18:36.283
and that's why I did that was because,

00:18:37.570 --> 00:18:41.710
before I caught that case, he
was taking advantage of her

00:18:41.710 --> 00:18:44.890
while we were gone, me
and my mom and stuff.

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:49.890
And him and his girlfriend
would babysit my sister.

00:18:50.320 --> 00:18:55.320
And while we were all gone,
thinking everything's okay,

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:58.597
he was having sex with her.

00:18:58.597 --> 00:19:00.877
He was manipulating her,

00:19:00.877 --> 00:19:03.150
and he made her fall in love with him,

00:19:03.150 --> 00:19:07.890
and by that time, she's
thinking this guy loves her,

00:19:07.890 --> 00:19:10.759
and she had no idea.

00:19:10.759 --> 00:19:13.570
I mean, the girl was only 13.

00:19:13.570 --> 00:19:16.443
She was only 13 years old
when all of this is going on.

00:19:20.110 --> 00:19:21.400
Now she don't talk to me.

00:19:21.400 --> 00:19:25.040
I wish she would and know
that I'm not mad at her,

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:28.070
but now she's just, I think
embarrassed or whatever.

00:19:28.070 --> 00:19:32.520
He kinda messed up her head,
and I feel bad for her,

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:37.520
but, it's something we both
gotta live with I guess.

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:44.473
But yeah, that was how my story ended up.

00:19:50.590 --> 00:19:53.010
Now I gotta live with this,
and I got to turn it positive

00:19:53.010 --> 00:19:57.463
because I don't know,

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:02.578
we're self-destructive to ourselves,

00:20:02.578 --> 00:20:07.420
and getting addicted to all
these drugs and stuff like that,

00:20:07.420 --> 00:20:08.880
it goes nowhere.

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:11.930
You end up with nothing
because before this,

00:20:11.930 --> 00:20:13.783
I was a working guy.

00:20:15.310 --> 00:20:17.980
Everything I did was involved in church,

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:21.813
and then, like I said, I
went to prison, and it just.

00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:25.810
I started learning how to deal drugs,

00:20:25.810 --> 00:20:27.660
going in the prison system,

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:30.563
how to make money within the system.

00:20:31.420 --> 00:20:34.310
If anybody knows confirmation,

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:37.300
in prison we collect confirmation numbers.

00:20:37.300 --> 00:20:41.930
We get the dope through freaking guys',

00:20:41.930 --> 00:20:44.740
people bring it in through
their ass or whatever they do,

00:20:44.740 --> 00:20:46.810
and they bring it in to us,

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:48.840
the ones that have the back job,

00:20:48.840 --> 00:20:52.530
and we break it up in the prison system,

00:20:52.530 --> 00:20:56.340
and we sell little specs
for a hundred bucks.

00:20:56.340 --> 00:20:58.870
And when somebody wants to buy something,

00:20:58.870 --> 00:21:01.373
they got to come with
a confirmation number.

00:21:02.540 --> 00:21:05.450
A confirmation number,
which is the green dots,

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:07.340
that's how we make money in prison,

00:21:07.340 --> 00:21:10.020
and we send it out to our family members,

00:21:10.020 --> 00:21:12.510
and then they ship it back in to us,

00:21:12.510 --> 00:21:14.400
put it on our books or whatever,

00:21:14.400 --> 00:21:16.090
and that's how we buy things.

00:21:16.090 --> 00:21:20.510
That's how we get cellphones,
that's how the system moves,

00:21:20.510 --> 00:21:25.030
that's how we become
productive, by being lockdown

00:21:25.030 --> 00:21:28.070
because you want to be able to,

00:21:28.070 --> 00:21:30.290
being a man, want to be
able to still provide

00:21:30.290 --> 00:21:31.220
for your family.

00:21:31.220 --> 00:21:34.620
So, whatever way, we always find a way,

00:21:34.620 --> 00:21:35.910
and that's how I did it,

00:21:35.910 --> 00:21:40.453
was start trafficking heroin
throughout the system.

00:21:42.690 --> 00:21:44.730
I was the dope man in the system,

00:21:44.730 --> 00:21:49.730
and it was kinda cool because
I was making a lot of money.

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:52.823
I was making a lot of money within.

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:59.100
I'll get a quarter ounce and make $12,000

00:21:59.100 --> 00:22:01.640
within a month period,

00:22:01.640 --> 00:22:04.343
and it was cool,

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:09.900
but, still, that money went so quick.

00:22:09.900 --> 00:22:12.440
When I got out, I had a house,

00:22:13.665 --> 00:22:15.469
I had my cars,

00:22:15.469 --> 00:22:17.258
and everything was there.

00:22:17.258 --> 00:22:21.640
It was successful to me, and
I met a lot of different type

00:22:21.640 --> 00:22:25.180
of people, and I came out
thinking I could be the same guy

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:27.290
that I was in prison because now,

00:22:27.290 --> 00:22:29.070
I now all these connections,

00:22:29.070 --> 00:22:31.480
