00:22:31.480 --> 00:22:36.480
And if you guys look me
up, I was busted for drugs,

00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:40.636
and they considered me the kingpin

00:22:40.636 --> 00:22:42.600
when I was on the streets,

00:22:42.600 --> 00:22:43.940
and I thought that was funny

00:22:43.940 --> 00:22:46.319
because when I got busted for that,

00:22:46.319 --> 00:22:49.860
they said I had a drug ring,

00:22:49.860 --> 00:22:50.900
which wasn't a drug ring.

00:22:50.900 --> 00:22:52.100
I was just selling dope.

00:22:55.755 --> 00:23:00.197
Now I learned how to do that,
and I was able to provide

00:23:01.370 --> 00:23:04.480
to my family within that, but
it turned into something else

00:23:04.480 --> 00:23:08.533
because, if anybody knows
about the dope game,

00:23:09.700 --> 00:23:11.110
you're still breaking the law,

00:23:11.110 --> 00:23:12.600
you're still doing this and that,

00:23:12.600 --> 00:23:16.310
and I started off okay.

00:23:19.300 --> 00:23:24.300
And then, people started dying on me

00:23:24.910 --> 00:23:29.230
as in, as we went along down,

00:23:29.230 --> 00:23:32.283
I'm trying to write this
story and keep it on track.

00:23:35.210 --> 00:23:38.800
When I got out, we started,
and I met a few people.

00:23:38.800 --> 00:23:41.060
We met up from the prison system.

00:23:41.060 --> 00:23:42.610
They happened to be somebodies,

00:23:43.470 --> 00:23:48.470
and they started providing
drugs to me at a cheap price,

00:23:49.260 --> 00:23:50.610
which I was in Victorville,

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:53.503
and I started moving and trafficking it,

00:23:53.503 --> 00:23:57.600
and within that time, I guess I was stupid

00:23:57.600 --> 00:24:02.440
because I was allowing a lot
of traffic to come to my house.

00:24:02.440 --> 00:24:04.100
A lot of people were coming to my house,

00:24:04.100 --> 00:24:09.100
and the cops were monitoring me now,

00:24:09.380 --> 00:24:11.800
and I had no idea.

00:24:11.800 --> 00:24:14.170
I had no idea the feds,

00:24:14.170 --> 00:24:17.850
when they're watching you or
the cops are watching you,

00:24:17.850 --> 00:24:22.850
that they actually have the
mailman as a undercover,

00:24:23.700 --> 00:24:26.883
while you think it's
just a mailman coming by

00:24:26.883 --> 00:24:31.180
to drop off mail, no, that's the cops.

00:24:31.180 --> 00:24:33.360
And they're freaking good
at what they freaking do

00:24:33.360 --> 00:24:37.670
because I honestly didn't
believe some of my friends.

00:24:37.670 --> 00:24:40.517
They're like, "Hey Tony,
you need to freaking stop

00:24:40.517 --> 00:24:45.027
"using your phone line
because they're watching you."

00:24:45.027 --> 00:24:47.297
And I was like, "Nah, that's impossible.

00:24:47.297 --> 00:24:48.627
"That's only in movies."

00:24:50.643 --> 00:24:54.730
Sure enough, my door gets kicked in again,

00:24:54.730 --> 00:24:56.410
and the cops come in,

00:24:56.410 --> 00:25:01.410
and they have pictures of
everybody that came to my house,

00:25:01.510 --> 00:25:03.610
everybody, even myself.

00:25:03.610 --> 00:25:07.856
They had me looking like I
was a freakin' supermodel

00:25:07.856 --> 00:25:09.760
or something, there was so many pictures.

00:25:09.760 --> 00:25:12.360
I'm like, "God damn, where
they get these pictures?"

00:25:13.310 --> 00:25:16.950
And sure enough, I find
out that the mailman,

00:25:16.950 --> 00:25:20.630
the guy that was putting up the signs,

00:25:20.630 --> 00:25:23.890
the guy that was just walking
down the street with the dog,

00:25:23.890 --> 00:25:25.090
they were all the cops.

00:25:25.090 --> 00:25:29.260
And they ended up taking me down for that,

00:25:29.260 --> 00:25:33.690
and if anybody wants to
know if this story's true,

00:25:33.690 --> 00:25:38.690
just look up, Tony Michaels
online under F77593.

00:25:40.226 --> 00:25:41.980
That's my prison number,

00:25:41.980 --> 00:25:46.260
and I do have a great bodily injury,

00:25:46.260 --> 00:25:49.600
to create great bodily harm with a weapon,

00:25:49.600 --> 00:25:52.940
