00:27:24.320 --> 00:27:27.690
And that's what I gotta do now.

00:27:27.690 --> 00:27:31.090
I gotta man up, leave the bullshit alone,

00:27:31.090 --> 00:27:34.280
stop associating myself with the people

00:27:34.280 --> 00:27:39.240
because within that, I
don't know if anybody knows

00:27:39.240 --> 00:27:44.240
