Just leave that alone, and
just use that as the past,

00:30:01.840 --> 00:30:05.423
and move on forward,
and live with your life.

00:30:08.190 --> 00:30:10.959
Like myself, now I don't talk to people

00:30:10.959 --> 00:30:15.060
when I say, "Oh, I went to
prison 15 years, I'm badass."

00:30:15.060 --> 00:30:16.730
Nah, it's even about that anymore.

00:30:16.730 --> 00:30:21.411
I use it as a past experience
as to, you know what?

00:30:21.411 --> 00:30:23.830
Maybe you don't want to go that route

00:30:23.830 --> 00:30:28.830
because I went that route,
and there's nothing in it.

00:30:29.960 --> 00:30:31.463
And that's what I do.

00:30:31.463 --> 00:30:34.040
