that's hurting out there,

00:30:39.280 --> 00:30:40.480
and that's what I try to do.

00:30:40.480 --> 00:30:44.090
I try to make positive at it because

00:30:46.990 --> 00:30:51.990
damn, we can't just stay in motion,

00:30:52.780 --> 00:30:54.770
let our past affect us anymore.

00:30:54.770 --> 00:30:56.090
We gotta go forward.

00:30:56.090 --> 00:31:00.130
